=== Reading ===
High coincidence (especially concentrated at round 1, where both seats face the identical symmetric empty board) => collision-by-destruction is producing the draws => defensive-cover is a collider in this matchup, not a genuine positional defender.
Low/scattered coincidence => the draws are NOT explained by shared picks => the competing hypothesis (collider) is disconfirmed for this matchup and the original diagnosis (defensive-cover out-defends mcts1k for real) stands, or the evidence is ambiguous.
